  qrCodeID: "Ana Topraklama G\xF6stergesi"
  title: "Ana Topraklama G\xF6stergesi"
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a19aaadcf7844142a73ce60950ec353, type: 3}
  message: "Ana Topraklama G\xF6stergesi, test arac\u0131n\u0131n ana topraklama
    ba\u011Flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n do\u011Fru \u015Fekilde yap\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6sterir. Sistem, arac\u0131n ana toprak hatt\u0131n\u0131 s\xFCrekli kontrol
    ederek ba\u011Flant\u0131n\u0131n g\xFCvenli ve kesintisiz oldu\u011Funu do\u011Frular.
    Ana topraklama ba\u011Flant\u0131s\u0131 uygun de\u011Filse g\xFCvenlik nedeniyle
    test sisteminin enerjilendirilmesine izin verilmez. Bu g\xF6sterge, y\xFCksek
    gerilim testlerine ba\u015Flamadan \xF6nce kontrol edilmesi gereken temel g\xFCvenlik
    g\xF6stergelerinden biridir."
